; Minimal sidecar manifest paired with `double.wasm`. The fixture's
; wasm is staged by `stage_double_hash_mismatch` in build.zig. Only
; one expr-func is declared so the host has something concrete to
; pre-flight; the hash check fires before the wasm runtime ever
; instantiates the binary, so the export need not actually run.
(plugin :name double :version "1.0.0"
  (expr-func :name vec3-length
    :arity (fixed 1)
    :params [vector]
    :result number
    :impl "wasm:vec3_length"))
